dzn: Treat a null descriptor set layout as an empty one

A pipeline layout may leave holes in pSetLayouts (VK_NULL_HANDLE) with
independent sets. Dozen skipped them when sizing its binding tables but
dereferenced them for the stage hashes, root parameters and static
samplers, and crashed.

From Oliver Bestmann's commit a10cfd5 in github.com/weaselway/mesa (MIT),
where dEQP-VK.pipeline.pipeline_library.graphics_library.independent_sets_random
passes (it crashed before).

